  "html": "<p>NPC is the abbreviation for Non-Player Character.  They are characterized by speech and/or the quest interface.\nIf the creature needs to be killed without any sort of verbal interaction, it probably will be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Monsters\" title=\"Category:Monsters\">Monsters</a> category.  Also in this category are various machines and devices, which may or not have an interface but will be named by mouseover.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-subcategories\">\n<h2>Subcategories</h2>\n<p>There are 5 subcategories to this category.\n</p><h3>B</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Bankers\" title=\"Category:Bankers\">Bankers</a></li></ul><h3>H</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Henchmen\" title=\"Category:Henchmen\">Henchmen</a></li></ul><h3>M</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Machines_and_Devices\" title=\"Category:Machines and Devices\">Machines and Devices</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Merchants\" title=\"Category:Merchants\">Merchants</a></li></ul><h3>S</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category/Skill_Trainers\" title=\"Category:Skill Trainers\">Skill Trainers</a></li></ul>\n</div><div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"NPC's\"</h2>\n<p>There are 141 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/AFK_Bolshevist\" title=\"AFK Bolshevist\">AFK Bolshevist</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Abba_labba_statue\" title=\"Abba labba statue\">Abba labba statue</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Abel_Tukahst\" title=\"Abel Tukahst\">Abel Tukahst</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/AbstractInsertion\" title=\"AbstractInsertion\">AbstractInsertion</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Agent_Hammer\" title=\"Agent Hammer\">Agent Hammer</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Agent_Illiot_Fess\" title=\"Agent Illiot Fess\">Agent Illiot Fess</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Agent_Matt_Roach\" title=\"Agent Matt Roach\">Agent Matt Roach</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Agent_Prohi\" title=\"Agent Prohi\">Agent Prohi</a></li